  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Economic Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project enables 2400 marginalised rural females in 5 districts to become economically active providers. Most livelihood support services do not reach poor people in remote target remote villages. Vocational, technical training will be provided along with entrepreneurial skills. Women trained for empowerment will increase service access and enable participation in communities. Men and youth will be educated and trained on alcohol, gender stereotypes and gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
